      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "后来，莱茵力量看到了\n正在训练的勇敢之心，\n她的身姿显得很疲惫。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8e7a673d6af5191978e6708ff35a413a7f054fbb1d6eb3562035e616982de674",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
