      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "必须要更认真的面对比赛。\n为了『报知杯雌马赛』，\n她重新开始训练。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a01480a8ae3065ab994fafdb076d35d87a34b90a231a54bf1eb9facbbdb35cb2",
